WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:05.133
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:05.133 --> 00:00:08.534
[ Alert chimes ]

00:00:08.901 --> 00:00:09.934
-I'm trying to sleep.

00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:11.868
Who's texting me?

00:00:11.868 --> 00:00:13.834
Santa Claus?!

00:00:13.834 --> 00:00:14.634
-"Hi, Jimmy.

00:00:14.634 --> 00:00:15.667
It's Santa Claus.

00:00:15.667 --> 00:00:16.767
Ho, ho, ho."

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:17.767
Classic.

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:18.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.834 --> 00:00:19.968
"I just wanted
to let you know you're

00:00:19.968 --> 00:00:21.934
on the naughty list this year.

00:00:21.934 --> 00:00:23.133
No cap."

00:00:23.133 --> 00:00:25.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.267 --> 00:00:26.467
The naughty list?!

00:00:26.467 --> 00:00:27.634
This is awful!

00:00:27.634 --> 00:00:29.400
My Christmas is ruined!

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.701
-Did someone say Christmas?

00:00:30.701 --> 00:00:33.901
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:33.901 --> 00:00:35.534
-Mariah!
-Did someone say Christmas?!

00:00:35.534 --> 00:00:36.734
-Mariah!

00:00:36.734 --> 00:00:39.501
Mariah, I-I-I just got a text
from Santa Claus.

00:00:39.501 --> 00:00:40.400
-Oh, my gosh.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.634
Okay, wait, let me guess.

00:00:42.634 --> 00:00:43.868
You're on the naughty list.

00:00:43.868 --> 00:00:45.501
-Yeah, how'd you know?

00:00:45.501 --> 00:00:47.234
-Well,

00:00:47.234 --> 00:00:49.667
I mean, hi, I'm Mariah Carey
and --

00:00:49.667 --> 00:00:51.601
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah, I get it, yeah, yeah.

00:00:51.601 --> 00:00:53.100
[ Cheering and applause ]
But I --

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:53.801
-[ Laughs ]
-Of course.

00:00:53.801 --> 00:00:54.868
I-I-I just don't know.

00:00:54.868 --> 00:00:56.701
I thought I was a good boy
this year.

00:00:56.701 --> 00:00:58.701
-[ Sighs ]
What'd you do?

00:00:58.701 --> 00:01:00.133
-Santa Sent me a whole list.

00:01:00.133 --> 00:01:01.434
Here, take a look.

00:01:01.434 --> 00:01:02.234
-Let me see.

00:01:02.968 --> 00:01:05.400
Wow, Jimmy,

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:07.400
this is a lot of bad stuff.
-I know, I know.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.100
What -- What -- What --
What does it say?

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:12.968
-It says you stole Questlove's
lunch from the office kitchen

00:01:12.968 --> 00:01:14.968
and blamed it on Tariq.

00:01:14.968 --> 00:01:16.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.534 --> 00:01:17.567
-I was hungry.

00:01:17.567 --> 00:01:19.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.167 --> 00:01:21.868
-You put a "Kick Me" sign
on Higgins' back...

00:01:21.868 --> 00:01:24.267
-Yeah.
-...and then started

00:01:24.267 --> 00:01:26.634
the Kick Higgins in the Butt
Challenge on TikTok.

00:01:26.634 --> 00:01:28.534
[ Laughter ]
-I did that, but it went viral

00:01:28.534 --> 00:01:29.567
and I didn't know how to stop.

00:01:29.567 --> 00:01:30.801
What else -- What else is --
-Okay.

00:01:30.801 --> 00:01:32.133
[ Laughter ]
Da da da da da.

00:01:32.133 --> 00:01:34.901
It was your idea for Netflix

00:01:34.901 --> 00:01:36.701
to start playing commercials?

00:01:36.701 --> 00:01:39.033
[ Audience ohs ]

00:01:39.033 --> 00:01:40.300
-Who doesn't like
the Geico gecko?

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:43.000
[ Laughter ]
I mean, come on.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.901
-Okay. Uh...

00:01:44.901 --> 00:01:48.167
You told Elon Musk
to buy Twitter.

00:01:48.167 --> 00:01:50.634
[ Ohs and laughter ]

00:01:50.634 --> 00:01:53.133
-I mean, he's already been
to the heavens with SpaceX.

00:01:53.133 --> 00:01:54.767
I figured, now,
he could see hell.

00:01:54.767 --> 00:01:57.367
[ Laughter, oohs, and applause ]
-I don't --

00:01:57.367 --> 00:01:58.601
I don't make these lists.

00:01:58.601 --> 00:02:00.834
[ Laughing ]
I don't know. Um...

00:02:00.834 --> 00:02:03.300
Okay.
Well, this part --

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:07.334
I mean, the drama on the set
of "Don't Worry Darling"...

00:02:07.334 --> 00:02:09.033
[ Laughter ]
that was you?!

00:02:09.033 --> 00:02:10.968
-Hey, all press is good press,
right?

00:02:10.968 --> 00:02:12.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:12.601 --> 00:02:14.467
-Not in my opinion,
but anyway, okay.

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:18.367
Listen, the shoes
with the individual toes?

00:02:18.367 --> 00:02:19.434
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah, you know what?

00:02:19.434 --> 00:02:20.901
That was a bad invention.
That's gross.

00:02:20.901 --> 00:02:22.901
[ Laughter ]
Yeah, I'm sorry about that.
-Oh, gosh. Okay.

00:02:22.901 --> 00:02:25.200
Well, what's this?
Wait a minute.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:27.067
What's this thing with Adidas?
-Give me the phone,

00:02:27.067 --> 00:02:28.434
give me the phone,
give me the phone, give me --

00:02:28.434 --> 00:02:29.567
[ Laughter ]
just give me --
hand me the phone.

00:02:29.567 --> 00:02:31.100
It was -- It was a bad idea.
Look, I had a --

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:32.901
[ Applause ]
-Jimmy, Jimmy, okay,

00:02:32.901 --> 00:02:34.601
you've been really bad
this year.

00:02:34.601 --> 00:02:36.334
Really.
-I know, I know. I guess

00:02:36.334 --> 00:02:38.634
Christmas isn't coming for me.

00:02:38.634 --> 00:02:41.067
[ Awws ]
-[ Sighs ]

00:02:41.067 --> 00:02:42.567
Jimmy,

00:02:42.567 --> 00:02:46.267
if Santa won't give you a gift,
I will.

00:02:46.267 --> 00:02:47.767
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:49.367
-Really?!

00:02:49.367 --> 00:02:50.901
-Of course!

00:02:51.567 --> 00:02:53.434
It's my new children's book.

00:02:53.434 --> 00:02:57.000
It's a fairy tale called
"The Christmas Princess."

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:57.801
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Thank you!

00:02:57.801 --> 00:02:59.534
-You're so welcome.

00:02:59.534 --> 00:03:01.033
-"The Christmas Princess"?!

00:03:01.033 --> 00:03:03.367
You have no idea --
this is what I wanted!

00:03:03.367 --> 00:03:04.501
-I figured you did.

00:03:04.501 --> 00:03:05.701
[ Laughter ]
-Thank you, Mariah!

00:03:05.701 --> 00:03:07.100
-[ Laughs ]
You're so welcome.

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:08.901
-Hey, what if we did something

00:03:08.901 --> 00:03:11.200
really big and nice
for my audience?

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:12.934
Maybe that'll get me
off the naughty list.

00:03:12.934 --> 00:03:15.434
[ Cheers and applause ]
-We can try.

00:03:15.434 --> 00:03:18.901
Wait, you mean like --
you mean like everyone here

00:03:18.901 --> 00:03:20.934
gets a free copy of the book?

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:22.634
Like --
-Yes! That's a great idea!

00:03:22.634 --> 00:03:24.334
-Yes!
Okay.

00:03:24.334 --> 00:03:26.601
[ Boisterous cheering
and applause ]

00:03:26.601 --> 00:03:28.334
[ Alert chimes ]
I love it!

00:03:28.334 --> 00:03:30.067
Love!
-It's Santa!

00:03:30.067 --> 00:03:31.934
-Whoo!
-I'm off the naughty list!

00:03:31.934 --> 00:03:33.868
-Ye-e-e-S!
It's a Christmas miracle!

00:03:33.868 --> 00:03:35.267
[ Cheering and applause ]
And you get a book

00:03:35.334 --> 00:03:37.667
and you get a book
and you get a book!

00:03:37.667 --> 00:03:39.667
-You get a book
and you get a book!

00:03:39.667 --> 00:03:41.234
-And you get a book!

00:03:41.234 --> 00:03:42.467
-But wait, but wait, but wait!

00:03:42.467 --> 00:03:44.167
-[ Laughs ] Oh, wait.
-Mariah -- Mariah...

00:03:44.167 --> 00:03:45.968
-Yes, yes.
-...you got me something.

00:03:45.968 --> 00:03:47.467
-Okay.
-What do you want

00:03:47.467 --> 00:03:48.534
for Christmas?
-[ Gasps ]

00:03:48.534 --> 00:03:49.601
[ Laughs ]

00:03:49.601 --> 00:03:51.434
Oh, here we go.

00:03:51.434 --> 00:03:52.701
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:03:52.701 --> 00:03:54.033
Jimmy,

00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:56.300
all I want for Christmas

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:58.000
is...

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.067
[ Ding! ]

00:03:59.067 --> 00:04:00.267
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:04:00.267 --> 00:04:01.767
See you real soon.

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:07.133
[ Bells jingling,
upbeat tune plays ]

00:04:07.133 --> 00:04:08.400
-Thank you for this book!

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:09.234
Mariah Carey!

00:04:09.234 --> 00:04:10.434
We'll be right back with more

00:04:10.434 --> 00:04:11.367
"Tonight Show," everybody.

00:04:11.367 --> 00:04:12.434
Thank you!

00:04:12.434 --> 00:04:15.300
♪♪

